u/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:55:    def is_arrow_pts(pts: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:62:    def arrow_dir_and_start(pts: list[tuple[int, int]]):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:85:    # Detect arrows per-color (cannot rely on global non-bg connectivity).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:86:    arrow_cells: set[tuple[int, int]] = set()\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:87:    arrows: list[tuple[int, list[tuple[int, int]]]] = []\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:91:            if is_arrow_pts(pts):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:92:                arrows.append((int(col), pts))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:93:                arrow_cells |= set(pts)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:96:        (int(r), int(c)) for r, c in np.argwhere(g != int(bg)) if (int(r), int(c)) not in arrow_cells\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:101:    for start_col, pts in arrows:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:102:        info = arrow_dir_and_start(pts)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:130:            if (nr, nc) in arrow_cells:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:174:    Output-first: for each arrow, plan the full zigzag ray path (with 0-4 side-touch\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:175:    bounces), place walls at bounce points, then derive the input (arrows + walls).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:178:    n_arrows = _rng.randint(1, 7)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt:181:    arrow_colors = palette[:n_arrows]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/tem3/combo_prompt_142ca369_11.txt