n.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/logs/combo_67e490f4/20260506_235648/gen_6.log:3085:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5545f144/D3/2/code.py:294:    Key insight: The sprite's current facing chooses which half-line to search, while each consumed marker dictates the next facing, so the arrows act as turn instructions rather than passive dots.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
